Princess Rescue Game (Scratch)

Play the game:
https://scratch.mit.edu/projects/1276553301

Description
This is an interactive story-based game developed in Scratch. 
A ghost king kidnaps the princess and the player controls a knight 
who must defeat skeleton enemies to progress through the game.

Features
- WASD keyboard movement
- Skeleton enemies spawn when defeated at random locations
- Enemies automatically approach the player
- Level progression after defeating enough skeletons
- Final boss fight against the Ghost King

